  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A willing creature you touch turns into living metal. Until the spell ends, its &amp;Reference[exhaustion apply=false]{Exhaustion} level can’t increase; it has Resistance to Bludgeoning, Fire, Piercing, and Slashing damage; and it has Immunity to Poison damage and the &amp;Reference[paralyzed apply=false]{Paralyzed}, &amp;Reference[petrified apply=false]{Petrified}, and &amp;Reference[poisoned apply=false]{Poisoned} conditions. If it has any of those conditions when you cast the spell, they end immediately.</p>",
